IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `masa-authority`

-- Monetary Authority of Singapore Act 1970, ss 6, 7, 8, 10, 12, 13, 14A-14C, 22, 22A, 145-149, 173, 176 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_monetary-authority-of-singapore-act-1970.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

